    "description": "Buổi 9 theo syllabus FLM.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADP301 · Chapter 2 · Session 9 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 9 — Performing Assignment 1:</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13657 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADP301 · Chương 2 · Buổi 9 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 9 — Performing Assignment 1:</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13657 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U,T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">U,T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Performing Assignment 1:<br>- Students visit the market (market / supermarket) beforehand to choose a product for which they will research and develop packaging design.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Syllabus, Slide, Textbook, Reference</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Do the exercise<br>Students make a presentation (slide) that includes the following<br>compulsory research items:<br>1. Market research:<br>* Introduce the company / shop / brand (trade name)<br>* Product introduction: product shape, features / uses, usage, materials, several types ... (with illustrations) ...<br>* Subject of customer (illustrated image)<br>* The market will develop products (if any)<br>* Competitors (logo, product, analysis of competitor's strengths / weaknesses)<br>2. Packaging orientation (including 3 orientations)<br>* List of packaging levels<br>* Orientation Structure / Die-cut / Material<br>* Orientation style / color design</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
