    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADP301 · Chapter 9 · Session 42 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 42 — Final Assignment 2</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13657 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADP301 · Chương 9 · Buổi 42 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 42 — Final Assignment 2</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13657 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO5<br>CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO3, CLO5<br>CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Final Assignment 2</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Syllabus, Slide, Textbook, Reference</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Assignment 2: Developing the Structural System of Primary &amp; Secondary Packaging<br>(multiple weights/flavors), at actual scale, using real or closely simulated materials (surface graphics not yet designed). Minimum of 3 different SKUs (e.g., 250g/500g/1kg or Flavor A/B/C).<br>Deliverables:<br>1. A physical set of packaging prototypes at actual size, using real or closely simulated materials (without surface layout design).<br>2. A PDF file documenting the process of AI application and evidence of personal adjustments during the project development.<br>Requirements:<br>- The packaging structure must include the following components:<br>+ Primary packaging: the container in direct contact with the product (box/bag/bottle), at accurate capacity and real size.<br>+ Secondary packaging: the outer layer containing the primary unit (outer box/sleeve/tray), optimized for display and stacking.<br>+ Materials: equivalent to production-grade (e.g., duplex/ivory/kraft paper, corrugated carton, PET/PP). If not available, use the closest possible simulation.<br>+ Die-cut/dieline: with clearly indicated dimensions, folds, and glue flaps.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
