    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADP301 · Chapter 12 · Session 60 · assessment / review</span>\n<h2>Session 60 — Final Assignment 3</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13657 · session plan</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ADP301 · Chương 12 · Buổi 60 · kiểm tra / ôn tập</span>\n<h2>Buổi 60 — Final Assignment 3</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13657 · kế hoạch buổi</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO3, CLO5, CLO6, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slides in this lesson</span><span class=\"v\">none from FLM</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Hình thức</span><span class=\"v\">Offline</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">LO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO3, CLO5, CLO6, CLO7</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">ITU</span><span class=\"v\">T</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Slide trong bài</span><span class=\"v\">FLM không có</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>What this session covers (FLM, verbatim)</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nội dung buổi học (FLM, nguyên văn)</h3></div>\n<p>Final Assignment 3</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Materials to read</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Tài liệu cần đọc</h3></div>\n<p>Syllabus, Slide, Textbook, Reference</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student's tasks</h3></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên</h3></div>\n<p>Assignment 3: Printing and Presenting the Packaging System at Actual Size + Submitting a Complete PDF Portfolio (A4)<br>Deliverables:<br>1. A complete set of packaging printed at actual scale, using real or closely simulated materials, with full layout presentation.<br>2. A PDF file presenting the full proposal of the packaging design system.<br>3. A PDF file documenting the process of AI application and evidence of personal adjustments during the project development.<br>Requirements:<br>- Print/simulate at actual size and produce a complete sample set for ≥ 3 SKUs.<br>- The complete A4 PDF portfolio must include three main parts:<br>+ Market Research (a selective summary from Assignment 1, updated if necessary).<br>+ Packaging Direction (summary of the chosen direction + rationale for excluding other options).<br>+ Packaging System Design.</p>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Detailed lecture and 🎬 video for this session: coming later. For now follow the slides, the materials and the tasks above.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Bài giảng chi tiết và 🎬 video cho buổi này: sẽ bổ sung sau. Trước mắt học theo slide, tài liệu và nhiệm vụ ở trên.</div></div>"
